            <title>[JGVT-3779] Reports_Audit Trail: System audit trail improvement for user roles (update JGVT-2569)</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-3779</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;administrator or business application owner&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; I want to be able to verify if users were temporarily created by an individual administrator not following the automated process.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;DEV NOTES&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;To check if new value/old value is available in the API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;TEST NOTES&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Validation NOTES&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SDLC-0000097786_system audit trail must be updated to include the additional filter&lt;/p&gt;</description>
