                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Generate and download an Excel system Audit trail report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;a Signals Experiment with a GxP-GMP General template&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the User requests the system audit trail via the external action (manual (&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2269&quot; title=&quot;Reports_Audit Trail: System Audit Trail- Ad hoc report generation&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-2269&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-2269&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;))&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the system shall extract the audit log data as per filters defined in &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2569&quot; title=&quot;Reports_Audit Trail: download System Audit Trail report via web user interface&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-2569&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-2569&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, in addition the below filter and generate a excel report with the following additional sheet and store it on the AWS S3 GxP qualified storage to be available for download request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A) The excel contains an additional sheet and filters for Users:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Users&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type:&#8194;&#8194;User&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;From date:&#8194;&#8194;&#160; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;eg.01-FEB-2026&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;To date:&#8194;&#8194;&#8194;&#160; &#160;&#8194;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;eg. 28-FEB-2026&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Action 1:&#8194;&#8194;&#8194;&#8194; Edited, Deleted/Trashed, Created&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s):&#8194;Standard User&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s):&#8194;Janssen Internal User&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s):&#8194;GxP Std User&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s):&#8194;GxP Superuser&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s): Administrator&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s): User name in audit log is different from service account&lt;br/&gt;
&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;B) Table (excel table format) with the following columns (column header are defined between &quot;&quot;):&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Date and time&quot; (data and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time))&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User Name&quot; (eg. full name like Tamara Van den Broeck)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User ID&quot; (eg. JnJ mail)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Resource Type&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Name&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&quot;Action&quot; (eg. create, edit, delete,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Changes Type&quot; (eg. Worksheet Changes, Row Modified, Row Added, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Details&quot; (eg. when no new value is available, copy worksheet, delete table,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Old Value&quot; (eg. lists the previous value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;New Value&quot; (eg. lists the current value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Event ID&quot; (Signals event ID)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;C)&lt;/font&gt;&#160;the downloaded excel file will have filename composed of the following components:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;SAT-MMM-YYYY_&amp;lt;&amp;lt;export timestamp DD-MMM-YYYY hh-mm-ss (24h format) UTC+ x offset&amp;gt;&amp;gt;.xlsx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

